{"date":"2026-08-27T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"f82c683d39d16a6d64c8c93eb547ac547ac78357","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Save","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":344,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"d863f37077f67bcd699b717b0a83585710b0f122","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Dates and Times","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-8"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":286,"deletions":30}}},{"hash":"ee909de5127c75428e5da4765f37e0a0a2a62509","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract Ui class for all user interaction","messageBody":"Amadeus.main() was doing three unrelated jobs: deciding what the bot\nshould say, deciding how it reaches the screen, and reading the user\u0027s\ninput. This moves the second and third into a new Ui class.\n\nUi now owns the Scanner, System.out, and the three presentation\nconstants (DIVIDER, NAME, BANNER), and exposes the vocabulary the app\nactually needs: showWelcome, hasNextCommand, readCommand, showLine,\nshow, showError, showTask, showTaskList, showGoodbye, close.\n\nTwo details are worth noting:\n\n- The single leading space that marks the bot\u0027s voice is now added\n  inside Ui.show() rather than repeated at ~15 call sites, so no future\n  message can forget it.\n- showError() is currently identical to show(), but exists separately so\n  error output can be styled differently later without having to work\n  out which of the existing calls were errors.\n\nThis is the first step towards the Ui/Storage/Parser/TaskList split;\nTaskList and the move from a static main() to an instance run() follow\nin later commits.\n\nBehaviour is unchanged: a text-UI regression run over three scenarios\n(fresh start, reload of a saved file, and a deliberately corrupted save\nfile) produces output byte-identical to the previous commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NgpCLhVX3riW8TrgWexAQd\n","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":150,"deletions":69}}},{"hash":"e5bc24e27e0aab0f9961ac394e9bbe67e155434e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Added A-Packages","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":44,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"82f5a7ea3a45f6219e7aa85e747146cf864e3623","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/add-gradle-support\u0027 \"Add gradle support\"","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"dbf75c103c520d6bcee1253f64c0de042f8181b6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add A-Gradle","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Gradle"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":3,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"b5470a9b6a7a85a429979d8f756e5e7973863aba","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add A-JUnit","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Jar","A-JUnit"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"txt":{"insertions":3,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":82,"deletions":0}}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"Polar1605":{"java":1171,"md":6,"fxml":0,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":3,"txt":3}},"authorContributionVariance":{"Polar1605":53755.49},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"Polar1605":"CS2103T-F09-4 CHEW..FRED"}}
